        <tr id="source-3"><td>3</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-campaign-early-access-live-now">Campaign Early Access Now Live</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>战役 EA 自 Oct 16 起；正式发售 Oct 23</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-5"><td>5</td><td><a href="https://support.activision.com/modern-warfare-4/articles/modern-warfare-4-editions">Activision Support · MW4 Editions</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>全球发售与 EA 日历；版本资格；平台列表</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-6"><td>6</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-intel-modern-warfare-4-launch-xbox-game-pass">COD Intel · Launch / Game Pass</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Oct 23 独立发售；发售时不上 Game Pass（至 Holiday 2027）</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-7"><td>7</td><td><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/4435490/Call_of_Duty_Modern_Warfare_4/">Steam · Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 商店页</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>页示 <strong>Release Date: Oct 22, 2026</strong>；<strong>仅外链</strong>；站内不设 AppID/价格栏</td></tr>
        <tr id="source-8"><td>8</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-live-worldwide-now">CoD Blog · Live Worldwide</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>官方全球上线文；日历日 <strong>Oct 23</strong></td></tr>
        <tr id="source-9"><td>9</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/05/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-announcement">CoD Blog · Announcement</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>正文定发售 <strong>October 23, 2026</strong></td></tr>
        <tr id="source-10"><td>10</td><td><a href="https://www.xbox.com/en-US/games/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4">Xbox · MW4 游戏页</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>Release date <strong>October 23, 2026</strong>（平台对照，非归因）</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
